  "behavior": {
    "roadmap": "Add a separate Roadmap tab while preserving OKR. Persist canonical storage/CAS/read receipts and ordered saves. Four actual local-Electron RPCs bind caller workspace and reject native/foreign/stale/unbound callers. Requested model is separate from nullable backend-effective provenance; warnings and late-response scope fences remain visible.",
    "budget": "Existing selected daily budget reserves the full remaining allowance before backend creation; only predispatch failure releases it. Every dispatched success/error/timeout retains unknown-cost unresolved quota until the existing exact trusted receipt reconciles it. Current per-instance owner fencing remains intact.",
    "sqlite": "Use runtime built-in Bun or Node SQLite through a bounded synchronous interface. Bun operations finalize statements in finally; readonly, closed-statement and integer-range controls remain. Real Node/Electron ESM and CommonJS operations run; the original CommonJS createRequire(undefined) failure is retained and fixed by actual filename/module-URL resolution."
  },
