    "resource": "Exact adapter, 20 constructor faults: Bun1.4.2, Node22 and Electron39 plateau at one additional descriptor while the seed connection stays open; zero immediately after seed closure. 100 throwing/retained statement controls release on DB close. This supersedes the earlier linear Bun node:sqlite-shim growth for these exact consumers; no immediate-flat-live-seed or universal allocator claim."
